{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35625","headline":"赴举别所知 · 李山甫","name":"赴举别所知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腰劒囊书出户迟，壮心奇命两相疑。\n麻衣尽举一双手，桂树只生三两枝。\n黄祖不怜鹦鹉客，志公偏赏麒麟儿。\n叔牙忧我应相痛，回首天涯寄所思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}